      "protocol": "Altera skill 440 at level 10 heals 3000. Equip the extracted Scholars of Chaldea variant with +30% received healing. Remove all other give/receive modifiers and ensure missing HP exceeds 3900. Record numeric HP before and after the skill, not just the healing popup.",
      "predictions": {
        "float32EachStep": 3899,
        "double": 3900
      },
      "remaining": "Connect the adopted reference contract through FGO Lab canonical IR, shared execution, outcomes and recovery; verify relevant production cells and parity.",
      "historicalObservationRequirement": "A legal skill/equip combination is now identified; actual HP delta and separate giver/receiver operation order remain unobserved.",
      "referenceContract": {
        "commit": "9fa75655c07ecd76168b1ccf5b8232e8d64664cf",
        "rules": [
          "Use IEEE-754 double arithmetic for the referenced HP gain expression; toModifier(v) is 0.001 * v, not the Float32 damage helper.",
          "Compute fixed base Value or percent base maximumHP * (0.001 * Value), then (base * (0.001 * receiveEffect)) * (0.001 * giveEffect), then truncate toward zero once.",
          "Receive modifier belongs to the recipient and give modifier to the activator. Preserve the reference no-healing and living-recipient checks and clamp the committed gain to maximum HP.",
          "For the recorded base 3000 / receive 1300 / give 1000 case, adopt 3900 before missing-HP clamp. Do not substitute the ratio-first Float32 hypothesis."
        ],
